mes. \ud83c\udfb2 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/4fFqrwh\" target=\"_blank\">https://discord.gg/4fFqrw</a> \ud83c\udf08</div> </div> </div> </div>super! thanks for invitation","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26777-bernhigg","name":"BernhigG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26777_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-06T13:27:49-07:00","id":1485933,"title":"","content":"Discord has its popularity for it's constant updates, and that it listens to its community for ideas on updates. It brings gamers a-like together in the thing they love doing, and it gives game developers the show they need. It just offers amazing things to gamers, and helps careers come about.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27476-colin86","name":"colin86","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-14T22:03:43-07:00","id":1493096,"title":"","content":"<b>We've come full circle - First Discord killed the forums in the last 5 years - now he's brought them back.</b> Good that the forums are back? (Discord writing time and searching for niche content, however, was very problematic on classic channels...)<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://discord.com/blog/forum-channels-space-for-organized-conversation\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://discord.com/blog/forum-channels-space-for-organized-conversation\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://discord.com/blog/forum-channels-space-for-organized-conversation\" target=\"_blank\"> https://discord.com/blog/forum-channels-space-for-organized-conversation </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-15T00:44:16-07:00","id":1493101,"title":"","content":"I wouldn't call it full circle. The Discord &quot;forum&quot; feature is more like Reddit (which is still a forum of course) than these forums. During COVID Discord had a lot of expansion of features as it was suddenly competing for a lot of users beyond gamers, and this is a function people have been asking of them for a long time due to how fast normal active Discord channels can be.<br /> <br /> Considering the function is still relatively new, I'd give it some time, but in all likelihood it is going to be the end of small forums like this one if you can put something close enough in a Discord server to satisfy those of us that like the slower pace of forums. There's little point in maintaining a Discord Server and an old school phpBB based forum if Discord can finally do enough of what these forums do. Just like lots of other Internet standards have been phased out in the past.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}